</label><caption><p>Change in mean hyperemia scores with travoprost BAK-free according to previous prostaglandin analog use. *p &#x0003c; 0.0001.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="co-2-613f5"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-co-2-613" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Patient demographics</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Eligible patients N = 796 n (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age (mean years &#x000b1; SD)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">69.4 &#x000b1; 11.8</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Gender</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Male</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">311 (39)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Female</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">485 (61)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Race</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Caucasian</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">610 (77)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;African-American</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">110 (14)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Hispanic</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">39 (5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Asian</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">31 (4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Other</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 (1)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Primary open-angle glaucoma</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">708 (89)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Ocular hypertension</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">77 (10)</td></tr><tr><td align=